{"title":"Drift Away","artist":"Steven Universe","sourceId":"reference:3r7yl1tJVbXUiOJl2ZcY","sourceHash":"2e7c599b4b5139c5fb17963cf4b8edfca32fa5fb79127b5fd7cc3cdff9be8d96","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":19.02,"end":21.13,"text":"Here in the Garden","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":21.13,"end":23.44,"text":"Let's play a game","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":23.44,"end":26.44,"text":"I'll show you how it's done","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":28.04,"end":29.61,"text":"Here in the Garden","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":29.61,"end":32.16,"text":"Stand very still","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":32.16,"end":35.16,"text":"This'll be so much fun","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":36.78,"end":38.46,"text":"And then she smiled","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":38.46,"end":40.49,"text":"That's what I'm after","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":40.49,"end":42.47,"text":"A smile in her eyes","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":42.47,"end":45.45,"text":"The sound of her laughter","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":45.45,"end":47.48,"text":"Happy to listen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":47.48,"end":49.84,"text":"Happy to play","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.84,"end":52.84,"text":"Happily watching her drift away","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":60.72,"end":63.02,"text":"Happily waiting","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":63.02,"end":65.18,"text":"All on my own","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":65.18,"end":68.18,"text":"Under the endless sky","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":69.57,"end":71.24,"text":"Counting the seconds","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":71.24,"end":73.37,"text":"Standing alone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":73.37,"end":76.37,"text":"As thousands of years go by","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":78.55,"end":80.14,"text":"Happily wondering","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":80.14,"end":82.0,"text":"Night after night","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":82.0,"end":83.96000000000001,"text":"Is this how it works?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":83.96000000000001,"end":86.96000000000001,"text":"Am I doing it right?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":87.11,"end":89.27,"text":"Happy to listen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":89.27,"end":91.73,"text":"Happy to stay","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":91.73,"end":94.73,"text":"Happily watching her drift away","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":101.68,"end":104.68,"text":"You keep on turnin' pages for people who don't care","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":108.61,"end":111.61,"text":"People who don't care about you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":114.74000000000001,"end":117.74000000000001,"text":"And still, it takes you ages to see that no one's there","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":121.72,"end":123.91,"text":"See that no one's there","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":123.91,"end":126.46,"text":"See that no one's there","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":126.46,"end":129.45999999999998,"text":"Everyone's gone on without you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":133.16,"end":135.46,"text":"Finally something","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":135.46,"end":137.51,"text":"Finally news","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":137.51,"end":140.51,"text":"About how the story ends","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":141.98,"end":143.62,"text":"She doesn't exist now","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":143.62,"end":145.89,"text":"Survived by her son","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":145.89,"end":148.89,"text":"And all of her brand new friends","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":150.53,"end":152.52,"text":"Isn't that lovely?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":152.52,"end":154.47,"text":"Isn't that cool?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":154.47,"end":156.49,"text":"And isn't that cruel?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":156.49,"end":159.49,"text":"And aren't I a fool to have","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":159.6,"end":161.61,"text":"Happily listened","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":161.61,"end":164.12,"text":"Happy to stay","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":164.12,"end":167.12,"text":"Happily watching her drift","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":170.32,"end":173.32,"text":"Drift","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":174.7,"end":177.7,"text":"Drift away","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}